  "description": "Beautiful Two-Bedroom Apartment in Quiet, Convenient Location\n\nBright and well-maintained two-bedroom apartment situated in a peaceful area, offering comfortable living in a convenient location.\n\nThe apartment comprises two spacious bedrooms, a main bathroom and en-suite, with both bathrooms recently renovated. The property also benefits from beautiful communal gardens and parking availability.\n\nThe location is particularly convenient, with a bus stop directly outside the door and the main village and supermarkets approximately a 15-minute walk away. A gym and swimming pool are located directly across the road, providing excellent leisure facilities right on your doorstep.\n\nA lovely, quiet apartment in a well-connected and convenient location.\n",
